        "slc_aaa2ee48c0078cb42df1a45e00ddf5731196e6aee20971cfff93c1efcf5f141b"
      ],
      "text": "dora is a CLI that turns a SCIP index into a queryable SQLite database, giving AI agents structured answers about a codebase instead of grepping files and reading imports."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9d28b22943393267a15dc812adabd93cf55e44a24e944f47405e9a0b0ffca1b9",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f4edb8fd349e142e78dea3258c3cd754a27d37bb",
          "git_sha": "ed9dd02df8d35ffd823e2bc3d22351c4df881263",
          "line_end": 158,
          "line_start": 158,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "butttons/dora",
          "url": "https://github.com/butttons/dora/blob/f4edb8fd349e142e78dea3258c3cd754a27d37bb/README.md#L158-L158"
        },
        {
          "commit": "f4edb8fd349e142e78dea3258c3cd754a27d37bb",
          "git_sha": "ed9dd02df8d35ffd823e2bc3d22351c4df881263",
          "line_end": 160,
          "line_start": 160,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "butttons/dora",
          "url": "https://github.com/butttons/dora/blob/f4edb8fd349e142e78dea3258c3cd754a27d37bb/README.md#L160-L160"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3480f8446ec5ddd0f8dfbc865250a3071e6d7beae390a67981348fae24f03d93",
        "slc_e3a86ad5299998928ca6546e1d77e7a50e7f699dd4d2c004f63e8c96f8508419"
      ],
      "text": "The tool has two layers: a SCIP layer that runs a configured indexer, parses the resulting protobuf, and loads symbols, references, and file dependencies into SQLite; and a tree-sitter layer that parses source on demand via WebAssembly grammars for things SCIP doesn't cover."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fdae466263ac23313f2e20b0c854cacdb6f206eff1a5bab5d3c94bd4c3887ef0",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f4edb8fd349e142e78dea3258c3cd754a27d37bb",
          "git_sha": "ed9dd02df8d35ffd823e2bc3d22351c4df881263",
          "line_end": 162,
          "line_start": 162,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "butttons/dora",
          "url": "https://github.com/butttons/dora/blob/f4edb8fd349e142e78dea3258c3cd754a27d37bb/README.md#L162-L162"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6d5bdb0b6d1cd227a2520cde69f7e13c3d766bdf396ae458f89e1e96d8947e8d"
      ],
      "text": "The SQLite schema stores denormalized counts (symbol_count, dependency_count, dependent_count, reference_count) so most queries are index lookups rather than aggregations."
    },
